  R["Results<br/>Managing for Results measures<br/>mart.agency_results"]:::have

  B3 --> A
  P1 -->|"ref.map_payment_agency<br/>411,060 of 411,231 lines"| A
  FS --> A
  FT --> A
  A --> F
  A --> R
  B2 -.->|"bridge for the 6 focus areas only<br/>(payee-name rules)"| P2

  G1["Gap 1 · Payments carry no program or<br/>spending code: a budget line can't be<br/>tied to a vendor (State data limit)"]:::gap
